{"id":"c10","stage":1,"title":"约一个时间","scene":"协调见面时间并确认约定。","roles":["敏智","你"],"lines":[{"id":"c10-1","ko":"토요일에 시간 있어요?","zh":"你星期六有空吗？","note":"시간이 있다 可以表示“有空”。","words":[{"term":"토요일","zh":"星期六","id":"9f4eef79554b65d0","audio":"/audio/9f4eef79554b65d023ca.mp3"},{"term":"시간","zh":"时间","id":"4692cef5ac69eb37","audio":"/audio/4692cef5ac69eb37bd53.mp3"}],"audio":"/audio/f1fbb5172e143752da66.mp3","speakerIndex":0,"parts":[{"text":"토요일에","meaning":"星期六","explanation":"토요일（星期六）+ 에（时间）。","readings":[{"term":"토요일","audio":"/audio/9f4eef79554b65d023ca.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"토요일에","audio":"/audio/0a45a76483d1b3b0e744.mp3"}},{"text":"시간","meaning":"空／时间","explanation":"시간（时间）；시간이 있다表示“有空”，口语省略이。","readings":[{"term":"시간","audio":"/audio/4692cef5ac69eb37bd53.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시간","audio":"/audio/4692cef5ac69eb37bd53.mp3"}},{"text":"있어요?","meaning":"有吗？","explanation":"있다（有）的礼貌疑问形式。","readings":[{"term":"있어요","audio":"/audio/499f8423f214354759ff.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있어요","audio":"/audio/499f8423f214354759ff.mp3"}}]},{"id":"c10-2","ko":"오전에는 바빠요. 오후는 괜찮아요.","zh":"上午忙，下午可以。","note":"은/는 可以对比上午和下午。","words":[{"term":"오전","zh":"上午","id":"1087feb238ccd110","audio":"/audio/1087feb238ccd11091f9.mp3"},{"term":"바쁘다","zh":"忙","id":"23457023f6034aaf","audio":"/audio/23457023f6034aaf6759.mp3"},{"term":"오후","zh":"下午","id":"7575a29f7d674595","audio":"/audio/7575a29f7d674595d2a0.mp3"}],"audio":"/audio/a61ca4655e3f70db75b1.mp3","speakerIndex":1,"parts":[{"text":"오전에는","meaning":"上午","explanation":"오전（上午）+ 에（时间）+ 는（对比话题）。","readings":[{"term":"오전","audio":"/audio/1087feb238ccd11091f9.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오전에는","audio":"/audio/99a7e1ef0f029d19b361.mp3"}},{"text":"바빠요.","meaning":"忙","explanation":"바쁘다（忙）→ 바빠요，으脱落。","readings":[{"term":"바쁘다","audio":"/audio/23457023f6034aaf6759.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"바빠요","audio":"/audio/e0ac65fa7828ce7c0656.mp3"}},{"text":"오후는","meaning":"下午","explanation":"오후（下午）+ 는（对比话题）。","readings":[{"term":"오후","a